      "zh": {
        "title": "航空事件彙整：Fedex飛機在邁阿密降落時滑出跑道 共6起獨立事件",
        "summary": "Fedex飛機在邁阿密降落時滑出跑道；另有5起獨立航空事件",
        "body": [
          "The Aviation Herald 報導6起獨立航空事件，發生於2026年11月24日及25日；報導未指出彼此有關聯。",
          "1. Fedex：11月25日，一架MD-11（ICAO機型代碼MD11）在邁阿密降落時滑出跑道末端。",
          "2. Western Global：11月25日，一架波音747-400（ICAO機型代碼B744）在東京的跑道上反向滑行時偏離跑道。",
          "3. Eastern：11月25日，一架波音777-200（ICAO機型代碼B772）在大西洋上空出現擋風玻璃裂痕。",
          "4. France：11月25日，一架波音777-300（ICAO機型代碼B773）在巴黎附近出現引擎電子控制問題。",
          "5. THY：11月25日，一架波音737-800（ICAO機型代碼B738）在巴統遭到多次雷擊。",
          "6. American：11月24日，一架波音787-8（ICAO機型代碼B788）在阿姆斯特丹出現輪胎洩氣情況。"
        ]
      },
      "en": {
        "title": "Aviation incident roundup: Fedex runway overrun at Miami among six events",
        "summary": "A Fedex aircraft overran a runway on landing at Miami; five other independent incidents were reported.",
        "body": [
          "The Aviation Herald reported six independent incidents that occurred on November 24 and 25, 2026; no relationship was stated.",
          "1. Fedex: An MD-11 (ICAO type code MD11) overran the runway on landing at Miami on November 25.",
          "2. Western Global: A Boeing 747-400 (ICAO type code B744) went off the runway while backtracking at Tokyo on November 25.",
          "3. Eastern: A Boeing 777-200 (ICAO type code B772) had a cracked windshield over the Atlantic on November 25.",
          "4. France: A Boeing 777-300 (ICAO type code B773) had an engine electronic control problem near Paris on November 25.",
          "5. THY: A Boeing 737-800 (ICAO type code B738) was struck by lightning multiple times at Batumi on November 25.",
          "6. American: A Boeing 787-8 (ICAO type code B788) had a flat tyre at Amsterdam on November 24."
        ]
      },
